&lt;p style="margin-left: 96px; line-height: 16px; margin-right: 6px; text-align: left; text-indent: -60px"&gt;  該当事項なし。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 96px; line-height: 16px; margin-right: 6px; text-align: left; text-indent: -60px"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
